--- title
# Christian Rafael de Souza Silva

--- body
Software engineer working on business applications, machine-learning infrastructure and systems software. Professional development since 2012; independent work includes language-model training, inference runtimes, compiler tooling and operating-system development.

--- actions
[GitHub](https://github.com/christianrss) · [LinkedIn](https://www.linkedin.com/in/christianrss/) · [Hugging Face](https://huggingface.co/christianrss) · [Email](mailto:crafael2030@gmail.com) · [CV (PDF)](/resume/christian-rafael-cv-en.pdf)
:::

::: section systems
## Areas of work

**Production software.** Enterprise management systems, fiscal and retail applications, desktop software, APIs and engineering tools.

**Machine learning.** Model pretraining, evaluation, GGUF inference, tensor computation and GPU-oriented execution.

**Systems software.** An x86-64 operating system, language toolchains, virtual machines and experiments with memory, drivers and graphics.

:::

::: section projects
## Selected projects

::: project period="2025 —" label="Operating systems"
### ChrisOS
Experimental x86-64 operating system with kernel, memory-management, driver, graphics and filesystem development; also used for compiler and virtual-machine work.

**C · C++ · x86-64 · OSDev · Compilers**

[Source](https://github.com/christianrss/ChrisOS) · [Documentation](https://os.christiansoftware.org)
:::

::: project period="2026" label="LLM pretraining"
### Chris-GPT-2
GPT-2 124M pretrained on approximately 10 billion FineWeb-Edu tokens using four NVIDIA A100 GPUs. Training artifacts and SafeTensors/GGUF model exports are available.

**Python · PyTorch · CUDA · NCCL · distributed training**

[Source](https://github.com/christianrss/chris-gpt-2) · [Model](https://huggingface.co/christianrss/chris-gpt-2-124m) · [GGUF](https://huggingface.co/christianrss/chris-gpt-2-124m-GGUF)
:::

::: project period="2026 —" label="LLM inference"
### Chris-Llama
LLM inference runtime in C: GGUF loading, tokenization, attention, KV cache, quantization and CPU/GPU execution.

**C · GGUF · inference · quantization · CPU/GPU**

[Source](https://github.com/christianrss/chris-llama)
:::

::: project period="2026 —" label="Deep learning systems"
### Chris-Torch
Deep-learning implementation covering tensors, automatic differentiation, optimizers and accelerated execution backends.

**C++ · Python · autograd · neural networks · GPU**

[Source](https://github.com/christianrss/chris-torch)
:::

::: project period="2026 —" label="Computer science reference"
### Engineering Manual
Bilingual technical reference on algorithms, data structures, operating systems, databases and system design, with structured learning paths and searchable articles.

**Python · Jinja2 · Markdown · JavaScript · GitHub Actions**

[Read](https://manual.christiansoftware.org/en/) · [Source](https://github.com/christianrss/manual)
:::

::: project period="2026 —" label="Research platform"
### Marginal Thinking
Research publication on macroeconomics, geopolitics and technology, including country profiles, recurring reports and primary-source analysis.

**Economics · data · research · publishing**

[Visit](https://marginalthinking.org/) · [Source](https://github.com/logicvisionai/marginalthinking)
:::

::: project period="2026 —" label="Market software"
### SharpEx
Market-data and portfolio workspace for cross-asset tracking, risk metrics and portfolio-level analysis.

**JavaScript · Cloudflare Workers · market data · risk analytics**
:::
