::: section research
## Research & technical writing

::: entry period="2026" label="LLM training"
### A Reproducible 10-Billion-Token Pretraining Run of GPT-2 124M
Technical report covering the training setup, evaluation and reproducibility of the Chris-GPT-2 pretraining run.

[Paper](https://www.researchgate.net/publication/412096883_A_Reproducible_10-Billion-Token_Pretraining_Run_of_GPT-2_124M)
:::

::: entry period="2026" label="Model specialization"
### Specializing a 124M-Parameter GPT-2 for Linux
Study of continued pretraining and canonical instruction tuning for a Linux-focused GPT-2, including failure analysis.

[Paper](https://www.researchgate.net/publication/412275606_Specializing_a_124M-Parameter_GPT-2_for_Linux_Continued_Pretraining_Canonical_Instruction_Tuning_and_Failure_Analysis)
:::
:::

